msgid "Activity Feed notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:168
msgid ""
"When you're mentioned in Mattermost while working in Microsoft Teams, "
"you'll receive notifications directly in your Teams Activity Feed. This "
"keeps you connected to important Mattermost conversations without "
"switching applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:170
msgid "**What triggers notifications:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:172
msgid "Direct mentions using @username"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:173
msgid "Channel-wide mentions using @channel, @all, or @here"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:174
msgid "Direct messages sent to you"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:176
msgid "**How it works:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:178
msgid ""
"When someone mentions you in Mattermost, a notification appears in your "
"Microsoft Teams Activity Feed. Select the notification to open Mattermost"
" and view the full context of the message. This feature uses the "
"``TeamsActivity.Send`` permission configured during the Azure app "
"registration setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:180
msgid "**Disable notifications:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:182
msgid ""
"System admins can disable Activity Feed notifications for specific users "
"or across your organization by configuring the "
"``disable_user_activity_notifications`` setting in the plugin "
"configuration. This setting is useful if you want to reduce notification "
"noise or if users prefer to check Mattermost manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365.rst:186
msgid ""
"Activity Feed notifications require the ``TeamsActivity.Send`` "
"application permission to be configured in Azure (step 6 of the `Register"
" an MS Teams app in Azure <#register-an-ms-teams-app-in-azure>`__ "
"section)."
msgstr ""

